                  </div>
                </div><img src="/images/Frame-12.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 49vw, (max-width: 991px) 356px, 462px" srcset="/images/Frame-12-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Frame-12-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Frame-12-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Frame-12.webp 1328w" alt="Four handcrafted clay pots of different shapes placed on a wooden surface with scattered clay dust." class="belive-image">
              </div>
              <div class="belive-card">
                <div class="card-item-wrap">
                  <div class="font-large">Purposeful strategy</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" class="card-logo">
                    <path d="M31.5 33C31.5 41.2843 24.7843 48 16.5 48H15C6.71569 48 0 41.2843 0 33H31.5ZM48 33C48 41.2843 41.2843 48 33 48V33H48ZM15.75 0C24.4485 0 31.5 7.0515 31.5 15.75C31.5 24.4485 24.4485 31.5 15.75 31.5C7.0515 31.5 0 24.4485 0 15.75C0 7.0515 7.0515 0 15.75 0ZM33 0C41.2843 0 48 6.71569 48 15V16.5C48 24.7843 41.2843 31.5 33 31.5V0Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <div class="belive-paragraph-wrap max-width-30">
                    <div class="font-normal center">We align business objectives with genuine, core needs, ensuring each decision drives us forward.</div>
                  </div>
                </div><img src="/images/Frame-13.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 49vw, (max-width: 991px) 356px, 462px" srcset="/images/Frame-13-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Frame-13-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Frame-13-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Frame-13-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/Frame-13.webp 1992w" alt="Glass chess queen piece surrounded by three glass pawns on a reflective chessboard." class="belive-image">
